  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass <math><mi>m</mi></math> and charge <math><mi>q</mi></math> is released from rest in a uniform electric field. If there is no other force on the particle, the dependence of its speed <math><mi>v</mi></math> on the distance <math><mi>x</mi></math> travelled by it is correctly given by (graphs are schematic and not drawn to scale)"
  },
